        "TileImage": "$($repository 5561ba7b-91a6-4403-a351-227015f67c2f).Image",
        "Description": "While we at GAMA have a long history of profiting off crime, there is a clear line that is drawn... crime where we don&apos;t get our cut! A drug ring has been running right under our noses, and these disrespectful fools thought they could deny us our cut.\r\rEliminate the conspirators at once: the pilot who brings in the raw product and sells to the surgeons; the two doctors who cut the final product; and the cook who sells to the regular staff.",
